WEBVTT

44:33.822 --> 44:36.450
Don't worry. You're safe with me.

44:37.493 --> 44:39.495
- I'll get you!
- (LAUGHING)

44:44.792 --> 44:46.460
Arya!

44:46.585 --> 44:47.753
Ow!

44:47.878 --> 44:49.546
What are you doing here?

44:49.672 --> 44:51.674
- Go away.
- Your sister?

44:55.552 --> 44:58.389
- And who are you, boy?
- Mycah, my lord.

44:58.514 --> 45:00.516
- He's the butcher's boy.
- He's my friend.
